{"title": "Killer's Sweetheart", "pageid": 10387, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Killer's_Sweetheart", "categories": ["Bugs", "Rings", "Very rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/6/69/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Killer's Sweetheart image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Ring_I_Gold_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Killer's Sweetheart</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> that makes the wearer's next <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> a critical hit after killing a creature, once per Long Rest.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Though the ring is highly polished, darkened slivers of blood still cling to small scrapes and corners.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 140 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  140  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Critical_CriticalExecution_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Critical_CriticalExecution_Ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Critical_CriticalExecution_Ring\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2f2d4bf3-6a14-43f5-81fe-e14aa9871215</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2f2d4bf3-6a14-43f5-81fe-e14aa9871215\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2f2d4bf3-6a14-43f5-81fe-e14aa9871215\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Critical_CriticalExecution_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Critical_CriticalExecution_Ring+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Critical_CriticalExecution_Ring+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Executioner\" title=\"Executioner\">Executioner</a></dt><dd>When you kill a creature, your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack roll</a> will be a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a>. Once spent, this effect refreshes after a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-833&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-729</span>: On the ground where the shadow copy appearing next to the Brazier is defeated in the <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Same_Trial\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Self-Same Trial\">Self-Same Trial</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Executioner:</i></p>\n<ul><li>After a creature is killed, the Executioner critical hit can be set to 'Ask' or disabled entirely in the <a href=\"/wiki/Reactions_tab\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions tab\">Reactions tab</a>, allowing it to be saved for later. Using it does not consume a <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Reaction\" title=\"Resources\">Reaction resource</a>.</li>\n<li>The automatic critical hit from Executioner can be applied to every target hit by a single AOE attack, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack\" title=\"Whirlwind Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Whirlwind Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Whirlwind_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack\" title=\"Whirlwind Attack\">Whirlwind Attack</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Razor_Gale\" title=\"Razor Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp/20px-Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp/30px-Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp/40px-Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Razor Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp/20px-Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Multiattack_Air_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Razor_Gale\" title=\"Razor Gale\">Razor Gale</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Executioner:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Despite the tooltip suggesting otherwise, Executioner only applies to <i><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon\">weapon</a></i> attack rolls.</li>\n<li>When using weapon specific abilities that impose a <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">saving throw</a> such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pushing_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Pushing Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pushing Attack (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Pushing_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pushing_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Pushing Attack (Melee)\">Pushing Attack (Melee)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/20px-Lacerate_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/30px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/40px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lacerate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/20px-Lacerate_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\">Lacerate</a>, <b>Executioner</b> attempts to apply its 'Natural 20' effect to the <i>enemy's</i> saving throw as well as the character's attack. This creates a risk of wasting the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_(Condition)\" title=\"Executioner (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Executioner\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_(Condition)\" title=\"Executioner (Condition)\">Executioner</a> condition to help the enemy.</li>\n<li>If the Executioner reaction is set to 'Automatic': the game forces the character's attack roll to a 20 (a Critical Hit) but <i>also</i> forces the target’s <i>Saving Throw</i> to a 20. This grants the enemy a high probability of resisting the secondary effect (e.g., they take the damage but are not pushed).\n<ul><li>If the Executioner reaction is set to 'Ask': The game triggers two separate prompts:\n<ul><li><i>First Prompt</i>: asks to turn the character's attack roll into a 20. (Recommend: <i>Yes</i>)</li>\n<li><i>Second Prompt:</i> asks to turn the enemy's <i>Saving Throw</i> into a 20. (Recommend: <i>No</i>)\n<ul><li>If the character accepts the second prompt, the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_(Condition)\" title=\"Executioner (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Executioner\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_(Condition)\" title=\"Executioner (Condition)\">Executioner</a> condition is consumed, and the enemy receives a large bonus to their save.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Note: While <i>Saving Throws</i> do not technically 'critically succeed' on a 20, the high roll often results in the enemy resisting the effect.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b>Wasted Charges</b>: due to a scripting error, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_(Condition)\" title=\"Executioner (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Executioner\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Executioner_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Executioner_(Condition)\" title=\"Executioner (Condition)\">Executioner</a> fails to check if the attacking character has already rolled a Natural 20 normally. If the character lands a critical hit on their own, the reaction can still trigger (and be consumed) if they either <i>accept</i> the reaction prompt <i>or</i> have it set to 'Automatic'.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195057\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1684/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 56737/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11914/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1181841/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.879      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   60.879      1 -total\n 20.61%   12.548      4 Template:Icon_text\n 20.21%   12.303      3 Template:Uid\n 19.65%   11.962     16 Template:Trim\n 14.36%    8.742      1 Template:WeaponType\n 13.89%    8.454      1 Template:Icon_link\n 13.62%    8.294      5 Template:Ifempty\n 10.53%    6.412      6 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.02%    6.097      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:10387-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195057 and revision id 371605. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}